---
---

<section id="caracteristicas" class="py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4 mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold">
        <span>Características de Nivel Superior</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Todo lo que necesitas para tus protocolos, en un solo lugar
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base">
        Diseñado meticulosamente para eliminar la fricción técnica y el estrés de los formatos académicos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Gemini AI Engine -->
      <div class="glass-card glass-card-hover rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors group-hover:bg-indigo-500 group-hover:text-white">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">Motor Google Gemini</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Impulsado por el modelo <code class="text-xs bg-slate-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-indigo-300 font-mono">gemini-3.8-flash</code>. 
            Utiliza tu propia clave de API gratuita de Google AI Studio, sin intermediarios ni suscripciones de pago.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-400">
          <span>Rápido, preciso y gratuito</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: UdeC Official Templates -->
      <div class="glass-card glass-card-hover rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors group-hover:bg-blue-500 group-hover:text-white">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">Estándares UdeC</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Adaptado con total rigurosidad a los encabezados, tablas y lineamientos oficiales de la <strong>Universidad de Cartagena</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-blue-400">
          <span>Estructura aprobada institucionalmente</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Individual & Colaborativo -->
      <div class="glass-card glass-card-hover rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors group-hover:bg-purple-500 group-hover:text-white">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">Individual & Colaborativo</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Cambia fácilmente entre protocolo personal o de equipo (CIPA). En el colaborativo integra síntesis grupal, aportes individuales y conclusiones compartidas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-purple-400">
          <span>Compatible con equipos CIPA</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Exportación Oficial DOCX y PDF -->
      <div class="glass-card glass-card-hover rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors group-hover:bg-amber-500 group-hover:text-white">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V9.414a1 1 0 00-.293-.707l-5.414-5.414A1 1 0 0012.586 3H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">Exportación Oficial DOCX & PDF</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Generación limpia de archivos Word estructurados según las plantillas oficiales y conversión nativa a PDF con alta resolución gráfica.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-amber-400">
          <span>Archivos listos para entrega</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </div>
      </div>



      <!-- Card 6: Privacidad & Multiplataforma -->
      <div class="glass-card glass-card-hover rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors group-hover:bg-cyan-500 group-hover:text-white">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">Privacidad & Multiplataforma</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Aplicación de escritorio nativa para <strong>Linux</strong> y <strong>Windows</strong>. Tu clave API y tus documentos se procesan en tu propio equipo sin intermediarios.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-cyan-400">
          <span>Linux (AppImage, .deb, .tar.xz) & Windows</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Spotlight Showcase: Sección de Instrucciones Adicionales (agnes2.webp) -->
    <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-700/70 overflow-hidden relative shadow-2xl">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        
        <!-- Text details -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-violet-500/10 border border-violet-500/20 text-violet-400 text-xs font-semibold">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"></path></svg>
            <span>Personalización Avanzada</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug">
            Agrega instrucciones y detalles adicionales a tu protocolo
          </h3>

          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Agnes cuenta con una sección desplegable de <strong>Instrucciones adicionales</strong> donde puedes especificar directrices particulares para la redacción: solicitar énfasis en normativas específicas, indicar tono académico riguroso o precisar cómo abordar determinadas secciones.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Real Screenshot 2: agnes2.webp -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="rounded-2xl p-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-violet-500/20 via-slate-800/40 to-transparent border border-slate-700/70 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-slate-900/90 rounded-t-xl px-4 py-2 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></span>
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/80"></span>
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80"></span>
                <span class="ml-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">Sección de Instrucciones Adicionales</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-b-xl bg-slate-950">
              <img 
                src="/agnes2.webp" 
                alt="Sección de agregar cosas e instrucciones adicionales en Agnes" 
                class="w-full h-auto object-cover block shadow-inner"
                loading="lazy"
                width="1366"
                height="718"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
